    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a cautious but curious relationship with mathematics. Though I studied physics and biology, math has always felt like a foreign language—precise yet abstract. I appreciate its logic, especially in scientific contexts, but I often struggle with its symbolic complexity. My low openness and high conscientiousness make me approach it methodically, yet I avoid deep engagement unless necessary.",
