    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Occasionally, I used AI tools to clarify math concepts, especially when tutoring my children or exploring physics problems. The experience was generally helpful—AI offered clear explanations and step-by-step breakdowns that matched my need for structure. Yet, I remained cautious, double-checking outputs for accuracy. My high conscientiousness drove me to verify results, and my low openness made me skeptical of unproven methods, but the support was valuable.",
